These data details the trajectories of 6 surface drifters deployed without drogue during a regular sea survey campaign referred to as "Acrobatica" 

Buoys are a set of cylinder-shaped home-made drifters without drogue.

For more details about this type of buoys, please visit: https://doi.org/10.5194/os-18-1703-2022
 
Reference time: local

To get a first look at the trajectories, visit: https://aztidata.es/ebegi/ (Platform type: "Drifters")
